  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Mar'li Evolves an egg on Mythic, never herself (#8075), and not on Normal",
  "contract": [
    "Evolve (2118116) evolves a target spider egg: it heals its target to full health (effect 67) and applies a",
    "+200% scale aura (effect 1). The egg is a gameobject (179985, size 1.75) that Evolve cannot target, so 22 s",
    "into the troll phase Mar'li (14510) swells the nearest free egg by Evolve's +200%, added to its size the way",
    "the core adds a scale aura (1.75 + 2.0 = 3.75), and that egg hatches 10 s later (live Mythic 2026-08-04: 10.2 s)",
    "as a Spawn of Mar'li (15041) she Evolves, never herself, so she neither carries the Evolve aura nor heals to",
    "full health. The evolved spawn never takes Growth (2118117; live: no Growth on it), while the Hatch Eggs spawns",
    "still do. Evolve belongs to Mythic and Ascended only, so a Normal Mar'li never casts it. A Normal and a Mythic",
    "hero each fight one Mar'li alone. The world's eggs share phase 1 and the fixture lives in the lane's own phase,",
    "so each hero places eleven untimed eggs right after the pull (eggs on a hero before it keep Mar'li from",
    "engaging). The Normal hero stacks all eleven on its spot: Hatch Eggs at 17 s claims the ten nearest and hatches",
    "them 10 s later, so it sees ten spawns, the eleventh egg unclaimed. The Mythic hero puts its eleventh egg 10 yd",
    "north and stacks ten on its spot; Hatch Eggs claims those ten, then the hero steps onto the eleventh, the only",
    "free egg left for Evolve, so the nearest egg it measures is the evolved one. On the old behaviour a spawn",
    "carrying Evolve appears at once and the egg never swells; with Growth it would make eleven Growth carriers."
  ],
